.TP
ifg\-commit(1)
Write commits on the server without a local checkout
.TP
ifg\-branch(1)
Work with repository branches
.TP
ifg\-ci(1)
Work with CI pipelines
.TP
ifg\-events(1)
Read the repository event log by cursor
.TP
ifg\-collab(1)
Coordinate agent sessions, tasks, messages and handoffs
